 "note": "S, 13 platforms, open, inward. A round ring of four platforms on the hub's diagonals, joined by curved quarter arcs, circles a 4-way grinder hub (a rotor with no fixed deck: its pair of bridges turns from one diagonal to the other, killing what is on it). Each home's two pockets land on the ring's near side; a high platform over the top pocket drops onto the ring too. Point-symmetric. Survivor ring: the hub and the ring.",
